---
title: Size-class axis
type: doc
---

::summary
The 0.18 responsive axis: typed layouts, per-size-class values, and
class-conditional chrome. Rendered at 390 / 834 / 1280 to pin all three
classes.
::

::app-shell[layout=adaptive mobile=tabs tablet=rail desktop=sidebar]

::: sidebar[position=left collapsible=true width="0 72 260" min-class=tablet]
::: nav-tree[source=files]
- src/
  - main.rs *
  - render_html.rs
:::
:::

::: toolbar[title="Library"]
- button "Run" action=run icon=play primary
:::

::: tab-bar[active=library]
- library "Library" {icon=book role=primary}
- inbox "Inbox" {icon=tray unread}
- more "More" {icon=ellipsis role=more}
:::

::: tab-content[tab=library width="0 700 880" align=center]
Ruled centered column: full-bleed on mobile, 700 on tablet, 880 on desktop.
:::

::: panel[position=bottom resizable=false height=160 classes=desktop]
::: problem-list[source=diagnostics]
:::
:::

::: panel[position=right resizable=false desktop-only=true]
Deprecated alias — still parses, lints as L042.
:::

::

::drawer[name=filters position=right width="320 380 420" min-class=tablet]
Filters live in a drawer from tablet up.
::

::features[cols="1 2 3"]
### One column on phones {icon=phone}
The triple is mobile / tablet / desktop.

### Two on tablets {icon=tablet}
A single value would broadcast to all three.

### Three on desktop {icon=monitor}
Unknown tokens degrade; they never fail a render.
::

